'''Seer''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that is obtainable by [[crafting]] it or through trading.    

==Appearance==
Its green colored blade takes a jagged shape with black hemispheres varying in different sizes attached to it. The guard and handle are black with neon green cracks. On the guard are four green colored eyes of the overseer with black slit pupils, hence the name.

==Trivia ==
*It requires 20 legendary [[Shards|shards]] to craft it, meaning that players need to salvage at least ten [[Legendary Weapons|legendary weapons]] to obtain the required materials.
* Before the [[Season 1]] update, it originally only required 10 legendary [[shards]] to craft it, meaning that players only needed to salvage five [[Legendary Weapons|legendary weapons]], but now players must salvage twice the amount to craft one.
*There was a brief period of time in 2016 that Seer was unobtainable due to crafting being temporarily closed for maintenance.
*When salvaged, it provides 1 godly [[Metals|metal]].
*Seer, [[Tides]], and [[Heat]] were used to craft [[Flames]] before the [[Season 1]] update.
*It is the [[value]] indicator used on MM2Values.
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Seer]].
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/156467990/Overseer-Short-Sword Overseer Short Sword].

